{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Day [Bb/F]by [F]day, Dear Lord, of [Bb]Thee [C]three things [F]I pray:
[Bb/F]To [F]see [Bb/F]Thee [F]more clearly, [Bb/F]Love [F]Thee more dearly,
[Dm]Follow Thee [Am]more [Gm/Bb]nearly, [Dm]Day [C]by [F]day.
{end_of_verse}
